        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86080, 8 Inch Ribbon and Reed Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ribbon and Reed 8 Inch Pull is reminiscent of traditional French Colonial Decor. It is this classic design that has withstood the test of time and continues to be a favorite among designers and home owners alike for its old world charm. The 8 Inch Ribbon and Reed Door Handle is available in several different finish colors. This solid brass door pull will fit doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick and comes packaged with everything you'll need to thru-bolt mount it to your front door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-8-inch-back-to-back-pull-set-pair-emtek-btb-86080\"><b>Ribbon and Reed Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek French Colonial Ribbon and Reed Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
