                "description": "The Ribbon and Reed 8 Inch Pull is reminiscent of traditional French Colonial Decor. It is this classic design that has withstood the test of time and continues to be a favorite among designers and home owners alike for its old world charm. The 8 Inch Ribbon and Reed Door Handle is available in several different finish colors. This solid brass door pull will fit doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick and comes packaged with everything you'll need to thru-bolt mount it to your front door.",
